Drop images here to queue them for the next pipeline run.

Each image needs a sidecar metrics manifest of the same name, e.g.

    inbox/beach.jpg
    inbox/beach.json     {"views": 50000, "likes": 2400, "comments": 90, "shares": 310}

Files are consumed by the pipeline: passing assets move to outbox/, anything
that fails a vetting rule moves to rejected/ with the reasons recorded in
build/manifest.json.